seafile-server (14.0.8-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  Seafile 14.0 removes, renames and moves many configuration options. Read the
  changes offered for the files in /etc/seafile carefully instead of keeping
  the old versions, and check your own settings against
  https://github.com/dionysius/seafile-deb/wiki/Upgrading#upgrading-to-140

  WebDAV now only runs with ENABLE_SEAFDAV=true in seafile.env.

 -- dionysius <dragon.dionysius@gmail.com>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 17:05:37 +0200
